  "content": "<section class=\"gl-hero\" aria-labelledby=\"gl-hero-heading\"><div class=\"gl-hero-video\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><iframe data-hero-start=\"5\" title=\"GioLina wedding film background\" src=\"https://player.vimeo.com/video/548643452?background=1&amp;autoplay=1&amp;muted=1&amp;loop=1&amp;playsinline=1#t=5s\" allow=\"autoplay; fullscreen\" tabindex=\"-1\"></iframe></div><div class=\"gl-hero-copy\"><p class=\"gl-eyebrow\">Wedding cinematography &amp; photography</p><h1 id=\"gl-hero-heading\"><span>Wedding films</span><span>with a personal</span><span>perspective.</span></h1><p class=\"gl-hero-sub\">Beautifully captured. Deeply felt.</p><a class=\"gl-button gl-button-light\" href=\"/contact-us-2/\">Inquire</a></div><script type=\"module\" src=\"/homepage-hero-video.js\"></script></section>\n<section class=\"gl-home-bridge\" aria-label=\"Introducing GioLina\"><p>Films and photographs, thoughtfully made.</p><p>We get to know you, prepare carefully, and give you room to enjoy the day.</p></section>\n<section class=\"gl-home-stories gl-home-selection\" aria-labelledby=\"gl-stories-title\"><h2 id=\"gl-stories-title\">Films &amp; photographs</h2><div class=\"gl-story-grid\"><article><div class=\"gl-film-preview gl-home-media\"><img src=\"/assets/9d28de469d3f3c6b.jpg\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Black and white wedding portrait\"><button type=\"button\" data-vimeo-id=\"548643452\" data-film-title=\"GioLina wedding film\" aria-label=\"Play film — GioLina wedding film\"><span>Play film</span></button></div><h3>Cinematography</h3><a class=\"gl-text-link\" href=\"/portfolio-2/\">Explore our cinematography</a></article><article><figure class=\"gl-home-media\"><img src=\"/assets/7353475231731939.jpg\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"A wedding couple together beside the waterfront\"></figure><h3>Photography</h3><a class=\"gl-text-link\" href=\"/portfolio/\">Explore our photography</a></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-same-day\" aria-labelledby=\"gl-same-day-title\"><div class=\"gl-same-day-intro\"><p class=\"gl-eyebrow\">Same Day Edits</p><h2 id=\"gl-same-day-title\">Your wedding day.<br>On screen that same night.</h2><p>A Same Day Edit brings footage captured earlier in the day into a finished film to share with you and your guests during the celebration.</p></div><div class=\"gl-same-day-grid\"><article><div class=\"gl-film-preview gl-home-media gl-bianca-edit\"><img src=\"/assets/690ef6c3e99444cd.png\" width=\"617\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Bianca and Bobby on their wedding day\"><button type=\"button\" data-vimeo-id=\"328842441\" data-film-title=\"Bianca &amp; Bobby — Same Day Edit\" aria-label=\"Play film — Bianca and Bobby\"><span>Play film</span></button></div><h3>Bianca &amp; Bobby</h3><p>Same Day Edit</p></article><article><!-- TEMPORARY ASSET: replace this 1600x900 image file with Francesca & Chris's final thumbnail. Keep the path and 16:9 card treatment. --><div class=\"gl-film-preview gl-home-media\" data-temporary-image=\"francesca-chris\"><img src=\"/assets/francesca-chris-same-day-thumbnail.jpg\" width=\"1600\" height=\"900\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Francesca and Chris Same Day Edit\"><button type=\"button\" data-vimeo-id=\"761102048\" data-film-title=\"Francesca &amp; Chris — Same Day Edit\" aria-label=\"Play film — Francesca and Chris\"><span>Play film</span></button></div><h3>Francesca &amp; Chris</h3><p>Same Day Edit</p></article></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-home-experience\" aria-labelledby=\"gl-home-experience-title\"><div><h2 id=\"gl-home-experience-title\">Enjoy the day.<br>We’ll take care of the cameras.</h2></div><div><p>Clear communication before the wedding. A calm presence throughout it. Careful attention afterward.</p><a class=\"gl-text-link\" href=\"/experience-2/\">Discover the experience</a></div></section>\n<section class=\"gl-home-inquiry\" aria-labelledby=\"gl-home-inquiry-title\"><h2 id=\"gl-home-inquiry-title\">Let’s talk about your wedding.</h2><a class=\"gl-button\" href=\"/contact-us-2/\">Inquire</a></section>",
